### 2.1 Microservice Boundaries & Responsibilities

1. **`identity-consent-service` (Go):** Manages multi-tenant organization hierarchies, clinician NPI/license verification, patient identity matching (Enterprise Master Patient Index - EMPI), SMART on FHIR launch contexts, and granular patient consent directives (e.g., opt-in/out for AI training, specific provider sharing).
2. **`ehr-interoperability-service` (Java / HAPI FHIR & Go):** Bi-directional translation engine. Terminates HL7v2 MLLP VPN tunnels (`ADT^A01`, `ORU^R01`), exposes compliant **HL7 FHIR R4** REST endpoints, executes **CDS Hooks** (`patient-view`, `order-select`, `order-sign`), and manages **DICOMweb** (`WADO-RS`, `STOW-RS`) streams with hospital PACS.
3. **`voice-ambient-service` (Rust / Python + LiveKit):** Handles ultra-low-latency (<300ms) bi-directional audio streaming via WebRTC. Performs real-time speaker diarization (Doctor vs. Patient vs. Family Member), medical speech-to-text, and voice biomarker extraction (vocal cord tremor, respiratory distress cadence).
4. **`medical-copilot-service` (Python / FastAPI / LangGraph):** Orchestrates clinical documentation generation (SOAP notes, discharge summaries, referral letters), automated ICD-10-CM / CPT medical coding with character-level source evidence highlighting, and pre-charting patient summaries.
5. **`document-vision-service` (Python / FastAPI / Triton):** Replaces the MVP's broken `report_processor.py`. Ingests PDFs, smartphone photos of paper lab reports, and handwritten prescriptions. Executes de-skewing, layout segmentation, table extraction, and optical character recognition, mapping outputs to structured LOINC codes and numeric UCUM units.


6. **`multimodal-diagnosis-service` (Python / FastAPI / PyTorch / MONAI):** Orchestrates specialist diagnostic foundation models across Radiology (X-ray, CT, MRI), Pathology (Whole Slide Images), Dermatology, Ophthalmology (Fundus), 12-lead ECG waveforms, and longitudinal lab panels. Computes calibrated probabilities and visual saliency maps.
7. **`clinical-decision-support-service` (Rust / Go):** The deterministic safety gatekeeper. Replaces `drug_recommender.py`. Integrates with **Neo4j** (RxNorm/SNOMED-CT) and **First Databank (FDB)** to perform deterministic checks: Drug-Drug Interactions, Drug-Allergy, Drug-Disease contraindications, renal/hepatic dose adjustments, and pregnancy/lactation safety categories.


8. **`wearable-telemetry-service` (Go / Kafka / Flink):** Ingests high-frequency time-series data from Apple HealthKit, Google Health Connect, Dexcom/ Abbott CGMs, Withings scales, and ICU bedside monitors via MQTT/gRPC. Standardizes payloads into **IEEE 11073 Open mHealth** and FHIR `Observation` streams.
9. **`remote-monitoring-triage-service` (Go / Python):** Replaces `severity_detector.py`. Runs stateful Complex Event Processing (Apache Flink) over streaming vitals and reported symptoms. Computes dynamic **NEWS2**, **MEWS**, and **ESI** triage scores, detecting subtle physiological decompensation hours before clinical crisis.


10. **`population-health-service` (Python / Ray / Spark):** Executes batch and near-real-time epidemiological surveillance, 30-day hospital readmission risk modeling (LACE+ index & Temporal Fusion Transformers), chronic disease care-gap identification (HEDIS measures), and Social Determinants of Health (SDoH) stratification.

