## 3. Core Platform Capabilities (Deep-Dive Engineering)

### 3.1 Voice AI & Ambient Clinical Intelligence

Clinicians spend up to 2 hours on EHR documentation for every 1 hour of direct patient care. MediScan's Voice AI acts as both an **Ambient Clinical Scribe** during consultations and a **Multilingual Interactive Voice Triage Agent** for patients.

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Doc as Clinician / Patient
    participant App as Mobile / Web Client
    participant LK as LiveKit WebRTC SFU
    participant VAD as Silero VAD + Diarization
    participant ASR as Deepgram Nova-2 Medical / Whisper-v3
    participant LLM as Clinical Copilot (LangGraph)
    participant FHIR as FHIR R4 Server / EHR

    Doc->>App: Initiates Consultation (Consent Verified)
    App->>LK: Establish Encrypted WebRTC Opus Audio Stream (DTLS-SRTP)
    loop Every 100ms Audio Frame
        LK->>VAD: Raw PCM 16kHz Stream
        VAD->>ASR: Speech Segments + Speaker Embedding (Doctor=Spk1, Patient=Spk2)
        ASR-->>App: Interim Transcript (<150ms latency)
        ASR->>LLM: Finalized Utterance with Medical Entities
    end
    LLM->>LLM:Incremental Entity Extraction (Symptoms, Negations, Dosages)
    LLM-->>App: Real-time Clinical Prompts ("Ask patient about radiation of chest pain")
    Doc->>App: Ends Encounter
    LLM->>LLM: Generate Structured SOAP Note + ICD-10/CPT Codes + FHIR Bundle
