## 10. AI Governance, Medical Safety & Regulatory Strategy

Operating a diagnostic and prescribing-support platform requires strict adherence to global medical device and AI regulations: **FDA SaMD (Software as a Medical Device - 21 CFR Part 820 / ISO 13485)**, **EU MDR & EU AI Act (High-Risk Annex III Class IIa/IIb)**, **UK MHRA**, and **India CDSCO SaMD Risk Class B/C**.

### 10.1 Regulatory Bifurcation Strategy (Speed-to-Market vs. Deep Moats)

To avoid a 24-month regulatory freeze before generating revenue, MediScan bifurcates its product modules:

1. **Non-Device CDS & Administrative AI (Immediate Commercialization):**
* *Modules:* Ambient Voice Scribe, Pre-Chart Summarization, ICD-10 Coding, and Evidence-Linked Clinical Guideline Search.
* *Regulatory Strategy:* Structured to meet all four criteria of the **FDA Non-Device CDS Guidance (Section 520(o)(1)(E) of the FD&C Act)**: (1) inputs structured clinical data/notes, (2) provides recommendations to a **Health Care Professional (HCP)** rather than a patient directly, (3) enables the HCP to **independently review the basis** for the recommendation (via full source citations, SHAP values, and transparent guideline links), and (4) is not intended for time-critical autonomous action without human verification.


2. **Regulated SaMD Modules (FDA 510(k) / De Novo & CE Mark Class IIa/IIb):**
* *Modules:* Autonomous DICOM Radiology Triage (CADt), 12-Lead ECG Arrhythmia Detection, and Automated Sepsis/Decompensation Early Warning Scores.
* *Engineering Controls:* Developed under **IEC 62304** (Medical Device Software Lifecycle), **ISO 14971** (Risk Management), and **IEC 62366** (Usability Engineering).



### 10.2 Multi-Layered Clinical Safety Guardrails

```mermaid
graph TD
    IN["Raw User / Patient / Clinician Input"] --> G1["Layer 1: Input Guardrail<br/>(Prompt Injection Detection, OOD Check, Crisis/Self-Harm Intercept)"]
    G1 -->|Suicidal Ideation / Acute Crisis| EMERG["Immediate Hard-Coded Crisis Escalation<br/>(Bypass AI -> 988 / 108 / On-Call Clinician)"]
    G1 -->|Safe Clinical Input| AI["Layer 2: Multimodal AI & Copilot Inference"]
